## Name, wordmark and icon

The MIT grant above covers the source code only.

The name "wgm", the wgm wordmark (the `wgm` lettering set in Instrument Serif
Italic) and the wgm application icon are **not** licensed for use in derivative
works. If you fork this project and distribute it, give it your own name and
your own icon.

This carve-out exists so that a build users download and trust as "wgm" is the
one published from this repository. It places no restriction on using,
modifying or redistributing the code itself.

